# Debugging & Test Credentials

When debugging features that require authentication, read `.env.test.local` for the test account credentials before attempting any browser-based or automated login.

```
TEST_USER_EMAIL   — test account email
TEST_USER_PASSWORD — test account password
```

## Notes

- MFA is **disabled** for this account in Clerk Dashboard (development instance).
- The Cursor IDE browser (`browser-use` subagent) **cannot access localhost** — it is sandboxed. Use it only for external URLs or deployed environments.
- For localhost debugging, ask the user to reproduce manually in Chrome and share DevTools screenshots (Network + Console).
- This account may accumulate workspaces across test sessions. If the onboarding flow must be tested, check the DB state first or use a fresh account.

